Improper Input Validation The application accepts user input for regex and directory paths, which are not inherently trusted and could lead to security issues if not properly validated., Improper Resource Management The server handles file I/O operations and directory traversal, which could lead to resource exhaustion or unauthorized access if not managed correctly.

